{
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1680,
    "height": 1240,
    "title": "How one TrialRun review moves",
    "description": "A GitHub pull request enters TrialRun's persistent Zerops control plane. One exact Codex connection is selected for the job. The runner creates an isolated Zerops project for the base and pull request applications, records browser evidence, publishes the result to GitHub, and deletes that exact temporary project."
  },
